{"items":[{"id":"792832809","root":"792832031","user":{"id":"203689","name":"强袭扎古","avatar":"51cb9067f20994941baa99e8"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1656/]a太拉了  广告哥都看不上\n以前每天日常好几蕉","time":1693301385524,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792833414","root":"792832031","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"我想的就是什么直播礼物，投桃也返点蕉之类的？\r\n但感觉猴子不会出这种途径，应该还是鼓励大家多活跃。\r\n我前面广场看到一个手机开播，又因为没什么人开播直接得了前30的金香蕉奖励~","time":1693302771994,"floor":1,"likes":2,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792833625","root":"792832031","user":{"id":"1224209","name":"HJM历史博物馆会员","avatar":"b947f4384fee7a93a9f433d0"},"text":"手机端每天做完所有任务有10金香蕉[emot=acfun,1734/]","time":1693303363774,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792833863","root":"792832031","user":{"id":"24200049","name":"修身养性好出家","avatar":"bd4600b4d46dcbb9d655fa8e"},"text":"投稿嘛，当当搬运工给A站增加内容，自然会有人投蕉的","time":1693303949508,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792844492","root":"792832031","user":{"id":"969238","name":"想不出好玩id的过气老登","avatar":"bd9121980105dc753b5b4e06"},"text":"礼物返蕉确实不错，主要还是猴子太不会骗钱，这么好的功能都不出，活跃度直接把观看时长那6个蛋的最后一个换成金蕉不就好了，普通香蕉很难有动力看满时长[emot=acfun,1688/]","time":1693343216802,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792844502","root":"792832031","user":{"id":"969238","name":"想不出好玩id的过气老登","avatar":"bd9121980105dc753b5b4e06"},"text":"投稿确实可以，但不能要求每个人都有时间有精力有兴趣去投稿啊，有的人就只想看内容，而且是大部分。但是这部分人苦于没金蕉又很难参与一些活动产出的道具，比如这次的头像框，要的也不多，几乎天天玩的情况下一两个月能买个改名卡的程度就可以了。","time":1693343509399,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"修身养性好出家","replyToUserId":"24200049","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792844504","root":"792832031","user":{"id":"969238","name":"想不出好玩id的过气老登","avatar":"bd9121980105dc753b5b4e06"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1654/]还真没注意，痛失一个亿！","time":1693343568274,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"HJM历史博物馆会员","replyToUserId":"1224209","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"51cb9067f20994941baa99e8":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/style/image/201907/RF6Dttpa5EiQYeII6QDN5BacoKcUJZt6.jpg?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/aBV4B2QKFU-qaA3Yz-jAVVRr-2Qzam2-QvmMVf.jpg?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/style/image/201907/RF6Dttpa5EiQYeII6QDN5BacoKcUJZt6.jpg"]},"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/kc450zvGig-qAbMR3-i2Ifyy-NnuMJr-36baIv.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png"]},"b947f4384fee7a93a9f433d0":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/1224209_8eb5452a0a45459a8a7cd21b18e97109.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/RLrg8HXCh3-fuQ3Ur-VZja63-m6v6za-BJnuEf.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/1224209_8eb5452a0a45459a8a7cd21b18e97109.png"]},"bd4600b4d46dcbb9d655fa8e":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/content/2021_5_22/1.6216873286316621E9.png?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/NO2GMXQRyO-NzQJJb-rieY3e-mY3U7v-vYjmuu.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/content/2021_5_22/1.6216873286316621E9.png"]},"bd9121980105dc753b5b4e06":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/969238_700d621a1196470da4170d6ca017c644.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/RLrg8HXCh3-fuQ3Ur-VZja63-m6v6za-BJnuEf.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/969238_700d621a1196470da4170d6ca017c644.png"]}},"emotio